nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsHxFZCd8p9_30OWUYeK0VZP8F7c1kst2CUehhSC9eVkw&oe=69A18DD7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QINuDMGHMdwQ7kNvwEUoywu&_nc_oc=AdmG3X4G54rm3vI-C73iHAIVl-fBbpBKi1XllLOywdC6Wpi1O6_IBK9pDHfdd5739C8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftUFXeN7BnnbDJoENrEs4r4J1MMnAbHiR0_Q3ohKnueng&oe=69A19315"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Ovl9tiEaZAQ7kNvwGhnj-s&_nc_oc=AdlDxihUTNEgnri5i1twBbC9qVXruNqAmS-dUSuUiIXXO6EST9c7OvEsV-WFEOG6k2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvFNO4uig_grwoup2RvPpivbeDW-m-gC8xy5I270YRlnA&oe=69A1A6C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AOMGJZOFRdsQ7kNvwG08Z7u&_nc_oc=Adkke9tdLjT9kP_npeavNOEBJM3_vZQHSoJB1C9gJpNQKSXddDmM18QbpNku9RWgeIk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft8_5MRj5-PFrszU8TyCGvFZk4deC_0DKkPWctNgHY45w&oe=69A18D44"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6qXvnnaz1qoQ7kNvwF-7OjZ&_nc_oc=AdlUmaV1qLy6DfNYwX8ln8ecaxogy7Vk_rL8u8K6AQIp8RLs-wGWh-FNFpas5uSsiTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu-16Z_jY5UsJbNbWs9dVyMAxZ58cWyntwWqhRYOe5vKQ&oe=69A185A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_874968084382960_490444167917392231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u8loIQnZa8YQ7kNvwE63VGl&_nc_oc=Adn4ik2x6FMI9Kw5zODjShYTKFVL0P5_soe_fXJb2Yj02EEgaZtblc1GhW-X-ZaZqHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuiN6wbjjuPi3DGPgY8O9Yfr3iWv91t17